 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * corrections: data/astro/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * Each entry is a region name in hand-authored-regions.jsonc and also the
 * whole-token prefix of every system name inside that region. Permit-locked
 * bodies inside otherwise-open systems (e.g. Diso 5 C, Lave 2) are out of scope.
 */
